      "writtenOn": "2026-06-26T18:01:47Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The reason I\u0027m not calling into `get_files_affected_by_patch()` is that I need to pass the `--raw` flag to `git diff` so I can get the file mode to detect gitlinks. The existing function passes `--name-only`, which doesn\u0027t contain that info.\n\nShort term I\u0027d feel better about leaving `get_files_affected_by_patch()` untouched so that I don\u0027t inadvertently break non-chromium consumers of this recipe module. Maybe long term we can modify `get_files_affected_by_patch()` to use `--raw` if things seem stable.",
